  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe ,Inclusive and Responsible Sport in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghten sport governance and practices to deliver safe, inclusive and responsible sport and physical activities for all. 

The overall NIF project&#x2019;s primary objective is to enhance opportunities for marginalized persons to benefit from and participate in sports. For to achieve this, NIF focuses on 1) To build lasting partnerships and networks to gain sustainable organizations that deliver safe, equitable and inclusive sports activities, 2) To enhance management resources in the development of inclusive and equitable partner programs with resources, and 3) Strengthened capacity of sports organizations to implement safe, equitable and inclusive sport. Emphasis is on the inclusion of women and girls, children/youth, persons with disabilities, and refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
